#AREA House of Horrors~
#AUTHORS Dazed  ~
#AUTHORS Dazed~




#HELPS
-1 'HOUSE OF HORRORS'~
{160}
Stories tell of an old haunted house somewhere along the roads of the realm.
Many great magical armors can be found there, for those worthy enough to
retrieve it.  Whether these rumors are true or not, is not known.  Those who
have ventured forth to seek this haunted house have never returned to tell
their story.  Perhaps you can succeed where others have failed.
{300}
     {171}Version 1.4 Sept 7th, 1998{300}~
0 $~

#RANGES 70 95 0 99
#MOBILES
#29800
birdquestmob little~
The little bird~
There is a little bird here.~
The little bird is rather beautiful. It is chirping peacefully.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY
AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
150 BODY_HEAD BODY_WING|BODY_CLAW 1d1+25999 10d10+300
0 0
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>rand_prog 100~
if quest(0,1,self) == 1
  mpecho A small peephole opens in the door and you see an eye peering at you.
  mpecho You hear the sound of bolts being drawn back. A key turns in the lock.
  mpecho The door opens with a creak, and a small, bent old man hurries you inside.
  mptransfer pcs 29863
  mpat 29863 mpecho The butler closes the door, drives the bolts home and locks the door.
  mpat 29863 mpecho The key seems to vanish, just like that.
  mpmset self quest 0 1 0
  mpoload 29821
  mpquiet on
  drop i29821
  mpquiet off
endif
~
>all_greet_prog 10~
mpecho The bell chuckles to itself.
~
>all_greet_prog 100~
mpechoat $n Don't attack me, whatever you do ... you'll ALL die.
~
