#29805
The attic.~
The attic here is no less dusty than the rest of the attic. There aren't even
mouse tracks in the film that covers the floor. An old bicycle stands to one
side, totally forgotten and a diary of some sort is lying in a corner.~
298 ROOM_INDOORS SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_WEST
The attic continues west.~
~
