diary~
This diary probably contains the deepest secrets of some little girl long dead.
There is a rather pathetic lock keeping it shut - you could most likely pick it
wearing boxing gloves.~
E
bicycle cycle bike~
The bicycle is a small one, meant to be used by a young child. It was, from the
way it looks, passed down from kid to kid rather more than a few times. You
doubt whether it is still operational.~
S
#29806
Servant quarters.~
You are in a room that is most definitely never going to win any prizes for
being luxurious. Functional - yes, but luxurious - never. There is a bed to one
side, a wardrobe and a bedside table. The stone floor looks uncomfortably cold.
There is a spiral stairway that leads down.~
298 ROOM_INDOORS SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_DOWN
The stairway leads down.~
~
