E
table bedside~
The bedside table has an assortment of odds-and-ends lying on it: a lamp, a box
of tissues, a book and a computer disk.~
E
bed~
The bed is a bed. It is used for sleeping on.~
S
#29807
The attic.~
The attic here is dusty, deserted and depressing. A few lifetimes' worth of
useless items are contained in this room. Old books, old photographs, old
postcards - just about anything old, actually. What a waste of space.~
298 ROOM_INDOORS SECT_INSIDE
