#29809
A bedroom.~
This bedroom looks used. There is a bed with a bedside table next to it. The 
bed is neatly made - with a black bedspread. The carpet is thick and soft. 
There is a cupboard in the corner. The walls are all panelled in a rich wood.~
298 ROOM_INDOORS SECT_INSIDE
