#29863
The entrance hall.~
You can't help but feel creepy when you see the entrance hall: it is cold,
creepy and miserable. The candles mounted on the walls do little to light
the room and they flutter in the draught that is blowing through the room.
The front door is south, looking just as imposing from the inside as from
outside.~
298 ROOM_NO_MOB|8 SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_NORTH
You can see a large hall to the north.~
~
0 -1 29858
E
door~
The door has many bolts, all driven firmly home. The wood is almost black
and looks extremely solid. You wonder how you are going to get out.~
S
#29864
The conservatory.~
This is a room of plants. Perhaps once upon a time the plants were well
tended to. It might have been once that there were fewer weeds than plants, 
but that is sadly not the case in the present time. A glass dome lets in a 
little bit of light - not much, as fungus has nearly fully covered the dome. 
You spot one pathetic but beautiful flower.~
298 ROOM_INDOORS SECT_FOREST
DDIR_NORTH
The lounge is to the north.~
~
