E
flower~
The flower is probably the last remnant of the beautiful place this must once 
have been. It looks very slightly lonely. Shame. Poor flower. *snicker*~
S
#29865
The porch.~
You are standing on a rickety-looking porch. It is raining and it looks as if 
it has been raining here for a very long time. The roof is incredibly rotten
and is leaking profusely. You attempt to find a place out of the drips, but
are not successful. There is an imposing door.~
298 ROOM_NO_MOB SECT_INSIDE
E
bell~
The bell looks very delicate and is intricately engraved. It looks as if it
would like to be rung.~
E
door imposing~
The door is solid, big and imposing. It looks somehow smug. You get the 
impression that it isn't going to let you open it.~
S
